   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"m_7259090012051675119_OLE_LINK3\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a name=\"m_7259090012051675119_OLE_LINK2\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a name=\"m_7259090012051675119_OLE_LINK1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Hi\r\nINLA team </span></span></span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<span></span><span></span>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">I want to run a Besag model at country level in\r\nthe Word shape file. I have 101 islands in my data set and when I run the model\r\nthe warning about” 106 connected components” appears. I have searched about\r\nthis problem and understood that the graph consists of 106 disconnected sub\r\ngraphs and I should change the adjust.for.con.comp = FALSE where TRUE is\r\ndefault. My problem is that when I change this argument, the predicted values\r\nare approximately equal to the observed data, I mean the correlation between\r\nthe predicted values and observed data are about 1. I run a simple regression\r\nmodel to see how the results are different from simple regression. The result\r\nis as follows. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:blue\">&gt; summary(lm(log(u) ~\r\n1+g_cat+m+ur))</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">Coefficients:</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"><span>              </span>Estimate Std. Error t value\r\nPr(&gt;|t|)<span>    </span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">(Intercept)<span>  </span>1.896e+00<span> \r\n</span>2.218e-01<span>   </span>8.549 7.34e-15 ***</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">g_cat<span>     </span><span>  </span><span>  </span><span> </span><span> </span>1.765e-02<span> \r\n</span>1.701e-02<span>   </span>1.037<span>    </span>0.301<span>   \r\n</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">m<span>           </span><span>    </span>-1.034e-05<span> \r\n</span>1.846e-03<span>  </span>-0.006<span>    </span>0.996<span>   \r\n</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">ur<span>          </span><span>     </span>-2.123e-03<span> \r\n</span>3.680e-03<span>  </span>-0.577<span>    </span>0.565<span>   \r\n</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">---</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">Signif. codes:<span>  </span>0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’\r\n1</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"> </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">Residual standard error: 0.6882\r\non 168 degrees of freedom</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"><span> \r\n</span>(93 observations deleted due to missingness)</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">Multiple R-squared:<span>  </span><span style=\"background:yellow\">0.01135</span>,<span>    </span>Adjusted\r\nR-squared:<span>  </span>-0.006307 </span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">F-statistic: 0.6427 on 3 and 168\r\nDF,<span>  </span>p-value: 0.5886</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The result of linear regression shows no association! I fitted a Basag model as follows:<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"></span></span></pre>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">formula.u&lt;- log(u) ~ 1 +\r\nf(OBJECTID, model=&quot;bym&quot;,graph=&quot;world.graph&quot;,\r\nadjust.for.con.comp = FALSE)+g_cat+m+ur</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"><span> </span>model.inla.u &lt;-\r\ninla(formula.u,family=&quot;gaussian&quot;,data=data.shape,</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">+ control.family = list(hyper =\r\nlist(prec = list(prior = &quot;loggamma&quot;,</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">+ param = c(1.0,0.00001), initial\r\n= 4))),scale=1, keep=TRUE,</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">+\r\ncontrol.predictor=list(compute=TRUE),control.compute=list(dic=TRUE,cpo=TRUE))</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">Model and results are stored in\r\nworking directory [inla.model-19]</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">fitted_logu&lt;-model.inla.u$summary.fitted.values$mean</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"><span> </span>summary(lm(log(u)~fitted_logu))</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">Residuals:</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"><span>       </span>Min<span>         </span>1Q<span>    \r\n</span>Median<span>         </span>3Q<span>        </span>Max </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">-3.912e-05 -2.494e-06<span>  </span>1.223e-06<span> \r\n</span>3.759e-06<span>  </span>3.030e-05 </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">Coefficients:</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"><span>              </span>Estimate Std. Error<span>    </span>t value Pr(&gt;|t|)<span>    </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">(Intercept) -1.626e-05<span>  </span>1.799e-06 -9.035e+00 3.54e-16 ***</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">fitted_logu<span>  </span>1.000e+00<span> \r\n</span>8.726e-07<span>  </span>1.146e+06<span>  </span>&lt; 2e-16 ***</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">---</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">Signif. codes:<span>  </span>0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’\r\n1</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">Residual standard error:\r\n7.829e-06 on 170 degrees of freedom</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"><span> \r\n</span>(93 observations deleted due to missingness)</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000;background:yellow\">Multiple R-squared:<span>      </span>1,<span>            </span>Adjusted R-squared:<span>      </span>1</span></span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\">F-statistic: 1.313e+12 on 1 and\r\n170 DF,<span>  </span>p-value: &lt; 2.2e-16</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#c00000\"> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">I don’t think the result from Besag model are\r\nrealistic (R2=1) and maybe I made a mistake! </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Can anyone help to explain what it means?</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Many thanks</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<span></span>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>"
    ]
   ]
